# Part of CaseFile Earth. Written with AI assistance; see docs/AI_USE.md.
# What `vercel deploy` uploads: the site, its config and strings, the copilot function (api/), the build script and
# the current results build only (results/current.json names it; the site never loads the previous builds).
# Keys never leave this machine: the copilot's key is set in the Vercel project's environment variables.
.env
.env.*
web/.env
web/.env.*

/.cache
/.claude
/.devcontainer
/.github
/docs
/prompts
/python
/templates

/results/*
!/results/current.json
!/results/r5

web/node_modules
web/dist
web/dist-offline
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
